msgstr "A gazdagép nevének beállítása"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1666
#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2669
#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2695
#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2807
msgid "Adjust settings"
